(6394691, 947950, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good story telling image. An urban doorstep... rose left behind... city lights blurred in the background. It tells the tale of love left behind, whether lost or forgotten or just too in the moment to pick up the spontaneous gift.</td>', 'Very good story telling image. An urban doorstep... rose left behind... city lights blurred in the background. It tells the tale of love left behind, whether lost or forgotten or just too in the moment to pick up the spontaneous gift.', '2011-04-25 09:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394692, 947937, 10785, '<td valign="top">The composition is slightly off for rule of thirds... if that is what you were going for. Other than that, great pop of color and selective focus! The entire subject is within the plane of the depth of field which makes it better.</td>', 'The composition is slightly off for rule of thirds... if that is what you were going for. Other than that, great pop of color and selective focus! The entire subject is within the plane of the depth of field which makes it better.', '2011-04-25 09:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
