(6395563, 947589, 69368, '<td valign="top">photos of chess games are  often very boring for me. to take my attention on these kinds of photos it needs a perfect composition and also perfection in techniks. I can''t see both here.<br/>You tried to catch some bokeh with the grid in background. this is nowhere near as good as a naturally bokeh, IMO. <br/>My eyes get a littel bit confuse, where is the main subjekt?<br/>Going with naturally light is a good idea, to bad you used it in an unflattering way.<br/> <br/>Sorry, I can''t find really good words for your work. <br/>Don''t vote yet.</td>', 'photos of chess games are  often very boring for me. to take my attention on these kinds of photos it needs a perfect composition and also perfection in techniks. I can''t see both here.You tried to catch some bokeh with the grid in background. this is nowhere near as good as a naturally bokeh, IMO. My eyes get a littel bit confuse, where is the main subjekt?Going with naturally light is a good idea, to bad you used it in an unflattering way. Sorry, I can''t find really good words for your work. Don''t vote yet.', '2011-04-26 09:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
