(6396843, 947175, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful little frog!  The pastels of the bokeh are really pretty, too.</td>', 'Beautiful little frog!  The pastels of the bokeh are really pretty, too.', '2011-04-27 09:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6396856, 947949, 65234, '<td valign="top">This may sound weird, but I think I''d like the bokeh better without the flower.  Probably wouldn''t score well but it makes a soothing abstract, like watching bubbles in a tank.  <br/> <br/>Or maybe take the color out of the flower?  You''ve got nice DOF and detail but it all just feels a little busy to me.  The bokeh isn''t enhancing the subject to my eye.</td>', 'This may sound weird, but I think I''d like the bokeh better without the flower.  Probably wouldn''t score well but it makes a soothing abstract, like watching bubbles in a tank.   Or maybe take the color out of the flower?  You''ve got nice DOF and detail but it all just feels a little busy to me.  The bokeh isn''t enhancing the subject to my eye.', '2011-04-27 09:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6396862, 947727, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like my Wood Hyacinths.  Very pretty bokeh here.  I''m generally not a fan of centered compositions but the tree in the background kind of pulls that together.  I might crop a bit more off the top (about 1/4 of it) to heighten the impact of the focussed flower.</td>', 'Looks like my Wood Hyacinths.  Very pretty bokeh here.  I''m generally not a fan of centered compositions but the tree in the background kind of pulls that together.  I might crop a bit more off the top (about 1/4 of it) to heighten the impact of the focussed flower.', '2011-04-27 09:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6396867, 947208, 65234, '<td valign="top">How can he sleep with all those bright colors around? ;-)</td>', 'How can he sleep with all those bright colors around? ;-)', '2011-04-27 09:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6396870, 947283, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and adorable expression.  I think I''d like to see some sort of definition in the bokeh; it''s rather flat-looking to me.  A good color to set off the Titmouse, though.</td>', 'Nice detail and adorable expression.  I think I''d like to see some sort of definition in the bokeh; it''s rather flat-looking to me.  A good color to set off the Titmouse, though.', '2011-04-27 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
