(6396878, 947230, 65234, '<td valign="top">Louie''s a hairy fellow!  Since this is a bokeh challenge, I''d prefer to see some sort of shapes or colors in the background to set him off better.</td>', 'Louie''s a hairy fellow!  Since this is a bokeh challenge, I''d prefer to see some sort of shapes or colors in the background to set him off better.', '2011-04-27 10:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
