(6401856, 947921, 124815, '<td valign="top">The "not voting" was a typo since I DID vote on this challenge and I was one of the three 10s. Just for the records. <br/>And I stand by my comment with increased firmness after the rollover. In a very naive way, I thought that in photography, by virtue of its medium, there is less discrepancy between perceptions than in painting for instance. <br/></td>', 'The "not voting" was a typo since I DID vote on this challenge and I was one of the three 10s. Just for the records. And I stand by my comment with increased firmness after the rollover. In a very naive way, I thought that in photography, by virtue of its medium, there is less discrepancy between perceptions than in painting for instance. ', '2011-05-02 13:37:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6401909, 947208, 131448, '<td valign="top">5 out of 10 is one thing... but who are the 5 idiots that gave it under 5. Trolls are everywhere.</td>', '5 out of 10 is one thing... but who are the 5 idiots that gave it under 5. Trolls are everywhere.', '2011-05-02 14:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
