(6402346, 947919, 35334, '<td valign="top">It is amazing to me that no one has commented on this amazing photograph! I love the tilt of the head and the direction of the eyes in the reflection. The hand is just right.<br/> <br/>~~DanW<br/></td>', 'It is amazing to me that no one has commented on this amazing photograph! I love the tilt of the head and the direction of the eyes in the reflection. The hand is just right. ~~DanW', '2011-05-02 21:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
